     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span lang=\"en\">Hello. At uploade shiny app, all packages are also upload. This takes a lot of time. <span>Is it normal?</span></span><br><div><span lang=\"en\"><span><br></span></span></div><div><span lang=\"en\"><span><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Uploading</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bundle </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">218359.</span><span style=\"color:#660\">..</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DONE<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Deploying</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bundle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1008417</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">218359</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Waiting</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> task</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">490455871</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  building</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Parsing</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> manifest<br>  building</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Building</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1007396</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  building</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Building</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> viridisLite<br>  building</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Building</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sourcetools<br>  building</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Building</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rlang<br>  building</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Building</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stringi<br>  building</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Building</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rJava</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></span></span></div></div>"
