    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The packages are not actually uploaded, but the particular version of a package you are using locally is built and cached.<br>It appears that you have <a href=\"http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/applications.html#build-settings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/applications.html%23build-settings&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360493085000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Jc9DfArV_ipMfYaWJ05A_\">disabled the package cache</a> for that application, and so every time you deploy it will recompile each package.</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Wednesday, October 4, 2017 at 3:13:42 AM UTC-4, A She wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><span lang=\"en\">Hello. At uploade shiny app, all packages are also upload. This takes a lot of time. <span>Is it normal?</span></span><br><div><span lang=\"en\"><span><br></span></span></div><div><span lang=\"en\"><span><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Uploading</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bundle </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">218359.</span><span style=\"color:#660\">..</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DONE<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Deploying</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bundle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1008417</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">218359</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Waiting</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> task</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">490455871</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  building</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Parsing</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> manifest<br>  building</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</spa